<title>USA: Imagyn Hysteroscope Sheath gets clearance.</title>
<headline>Imagyn Hysteroscope Sheath gets clearance.</headline>
<dateline>LAGUNA NIGUEL, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imagyn Medical Inc said it received clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market its Microspan Hysteroscope Sheath.</p>
<p>It said the sheath can be used in a wide variety of diagnostic and operative procedures in the uterus with minimal patient discomfort.</p>
</text>
